<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5291] SQL: plans cache does not clear on cache stop</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5291</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description></description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;After cache-schema decoupling mutation of &lt;tt&gt;DmlStatementsProcessor#planCache&lt;/tt&gt; appears to be broken (different pieces of code contexts operate different schema names), have to do this consistently.&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
        <key id="13074863">IGNITE-5291</key>
            <summary>SQL: plans cache does not clear on cache stop</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
