                            <comment id="16024863" author="al.psc" created="Thu, 25 May 2017 15:25:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Patch available. Problem was in cache stop routine of IgniteH2Indexing (cache-schema mapping was removed before call to &lt;tt&gt;DmlStatementsProcessor#onCacheStop&lt;/tt&gt; which internally needs that mapping).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
